            "review_title": "Review at Boho Cafe",
            "review_text": "Chloe Doberstein\n6 contributions\n0\nExcellent Service\nNov 2019 • Couples\nWe stumbled into this cafe on accident after taking a wrong turn down an alley. We have been talking about trying egg coffee while we're in Vietnam, but haven't had the opportunity. We saw it on the sign for Boho Cafe and knew we had to try it. It was creamy and decadent and delicious! What made the experience even better was our barista. She was warm and welcoming and helped us with a smile. I hope we get the chance to come back and try some food next time we're in Saigon.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 6, 2019",
