            "review_title": "Review at Boho Cafe",
            "review_text": "Sean C\nManila, Philippines14 contributions\n1\nFirst egg coffee - Cà phê trúng\nSep 2019 • Couples\nThis is great. Dragging the bitter coffee up through the stiffly beaten egg yolks adds an exciting dimension to the coffee.\n\nOur hostess is extremely friendly as well and gave us a few tips on attractions in the area - including where to get a great sunset.\nWritten September 13, 2019",
